msgid "Makes this Wayland desktop reachable from RealVNC Viewer on your phone or another computer. It listens on this computer only until you turn on Local Network Access."
msgstr "Hiki ai ke loaʻa i kēia pākaukau Wayland mai RealVNC Viewer ma kāu kelepona a i ʻole kekahi kamepiula ʻē aʻe. Hoʻolohe ʻo ia ma kēia kamepiula wale nō a hiki i kou hoʻā ʻana i Komo mai ka pūnaewele kūloko."

