#~ msgstr "ʻO 0.0.0.0 e hiki ai i nā mea hana ma kāu pūnaewele kūloko ke loaʻa i ka mea lawelawe; ke ʻālai mau nei ka lawelawe i ka pūnaewele puni honua. ʻO 127.0.0.1 e kaupalena ana iā ia i kēia mīkini wale nō. Hōʻole ʻia nā awa 1024 a i lalo."

#~ msgid "local network only; internet blocked by the unit"
